  "favourites_count": 14,
  "description": "<h1>SNACC pack for SPT 4</h1>\n<h2>Updated from <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/228/snaccpack\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/228/snaccpack</a></h2>\n<h3>4x4 Grid for anything food related as per original mod, Sold by Jaeger at LL1 for 150k Rubles</h3>\n<h3>Can be put into your secure container</h3>\n<h4>Originally by  DigitalBarrito, I reached to ask permission but had no reply, I will remove the mod if original author asks.</h4>\n<h4>Extract to your SPT install, it is configurable by editing a json but it break it don’t blame me!</h4>\n<h4>Requires WTTCommonLib 2.0.2 or higher</h4>\n",
